            "built": "Led the group of applications forming SNCF's client referential: replaced its commercial Oracle MDM with a Spring Boot application, cleared technical obsolescence across the platform (Java 8 → 17, Spring 4 → 5, Cloudera 5 → 7), and moved its clusters to a new hosting site.",
